a lot of the other applications

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.090
that we're moving out
to the cloud as well.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:30.620
And one of the big
founding tenets that we had

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.200
is everything
infrastructure as code.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.700
Everything
infrastructure as code.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.130
Nothing-- no console
stuff, right?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.340
We want to be able to be able
to spin these things up, tear it

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.070
