00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:45.300
So that was huge for us.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:48.920
So there again, the other
point that you see there

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.530
with the building
and adapt and move on

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:56.450
